## Save Restore

What to test:

- Click "Save" to capture annotation state, modify or remove annotations, then click "Restore" and confirm the saved annotations reappear.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Save Restore" name="annotation-save-restore" type="generated" /%}

## Chart Types

What to test:

- Switch between chart types (candlestick, OHLC, hollow-candlestick, line, step-line, HLC, high-low) and confirm each renders correctly.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Chart Types" name="chart-types" type="generated" /%}

## Readonly

What to test:

- Confirm pre-loaded annotations render but cannot be edited, moved or deleted.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Readonly" name="readonly" type="generated" /%}

## Async

What to test:

- Confirm a loading state is shown while data is fetched, then the chart and initial annotations render once the data resolves.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Async" name="async-financial" type="generated" /%}

